  "id": "flapping-relay-does-not-stall-nostr-setup",
  "description": "The own relay accepts connections and drops them again every two seconds while the Nostr relays work. Losing one mailbox must not reset the setup while another one reaches the peer: the parent's request for an offer stays valid, the baby answers it, and the attempt verifies in seconds instead of after the 20 s attempt timeout, with one attempt per side.",
